omx-dsp (0.17.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version 0.17.0 (#102, #103)
  * Drive face takes the contract's oversample control (#102)
  * Build against omx-contract 2.10.1 (>= 2.10.1, < 2.11); comp reads
    OMX_DETECTOR_OVERSAMPLINGS_4X (#102)
  * Key filter oracle, digests and sabotage at the nine RME rates (#103)
  * The gate's key filter runs its sections in double (#103)
  * The gate's key filter: hp_hz and lp_hz in omx_gate_controls and the
    instance's resolve (#103)
  * omx_gate.h states the key filter: hpHz and lpHz on the detector's key
    (#103)

